{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0700231f97b189df5948a55e92dd6d551d5be3049b08548e9d7ed6ba71bc8bef", "ja": "（やよいに話があるんだけど……\nなんだか話し込んでいるみたいだな）", "zh": "（我有事要找弥生谈……\n但她们好像聊得很起劲的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "cf023b557e8a68ef50d153d1690b02280c9e1ae5a77871ff2d5a1c6f22783474", "ja": "そうしたら、伊織ちゃんも……あ！\n{$P$}、お疲れさまですー！", "zh": "这样的话，伊织也……啊！\n{$P$}，辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "6dedda97cb8418149a7c2de3661a3cdfd48e9cc6d46be5e6570a159f86c9b7b8", "ja": "あら、いたの。かわいい伊織ちゃんに、\n素敵なお仕事でも持ってきてくれたのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，你在呀？\n你替可爱的伊织带来了很棒的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1003_p", "source_sha256": "751c823d942a7fb941978d4fb26798ab4462c91a9b53ae4e25dca4716c13469e", "ja": "鋭いな伊織、半分正解だ。\n仕事の相談なんだけど……やよい、今いいか？", "zh": "伊织真敏锐，你答对了一半，\n是关于工作的事……弥生现在方便谈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "56ec32aad63e4f773ec0a4b9f429a1aff2ee3b2d6bdacb7a630e35ace956d838", "ja": "あ、私ですか？　はいっ、大丈夫ですっ。", "zh": "啊，我吗？可以，没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d61045e036a9254a23572fdefb1ce4a39a2f5c80dea7aba85cc9bc693e7691b4", "ja": "次の劇場公演だけど、やよいのセンター公演で\n行きたいと思ってるんだ。どうかな？", "zh": "下次的剧场公演，\n我打算让你担任Center，你觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "0500352cd9f470c6c265dfaf83865cbd74c356870a5d3fcefbda764cc469dcca", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？\nもちろん、やります！　やりたいですっ！", "zh": "咦！可以吗！？\n我当然愿意！我想当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "a500c90967db6e659ca73ae8a974617fcb98763417799000a3edba7ceca50e9c", "ja": "今、ちょうどそんな話をしてたのよ。\n珍しく、いいタイミングじゃない♪", "zh": "我们刚才正在聊这个呢，\n难得你来得这么刚好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1008_p", "source_sha256": "895dcf4197372eeac0aa2c1139e8abab2fccca7d2cc058a33dcdbcb1798d9ed8", "ja": "それは良かった。それじゃ、次のセンターは\nやよいってことで。よろしくな！", "zh": "真是太好了。\n那下次的Center就决定是弥生了，麻烦你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "a46aebd9d0b9539ba0bb8bd825510f3a0e5646045cb8f5e6e2a365f6ac34a5a1", "ja": "はいっ！\n私、めいっぱい頑張りますねっ！", "zh": "好的！\n我会尽我所能加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8449c2a63a8589203c9aa49f8f31d6e1db61dedc1766b536d9a1e686d940945d", "ja": "ずいぶんにぎやかだな。\n何か面白いコトでもあったのか？", "zh": "真热闹啊，\n发生什么有趣的事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "807dcf544244dafad3defa2f8711d4dad507a68e26be03e1e2fbcf3e44a3e6e2", "ja": "あ、ジュリアさん！\n次の公演、私がセンターをやることになりましたー！", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚姊姊！\n下次公演决定由我担任Center了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a432a3878022205721dae7232d42a6a2c37804678c9e71bb4a9bf45ce2275dd", "ja": "へえ、ヤッコのセンター公演か！\nそいつは確かに、面白くなりそうだ！", "zh": "哦？弥子的Center公演吗！\n感觉的确会很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "7cdfbdaec3b0148745ce6aa4836b0985972814e397019e10d116d9195e0702ab", "ja": "しかも、この伊織ちゃんも出るんだから。\n最高に盛り上がること確定だわ♪", "zh": "而且伊织我也会参加，\n可以确定气氛会非常热烈喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d881dad2e86917247cbf1a7383009c9a945b40ad93a34037f23c4ca6cdc99ca0", "ja": "（おお、頼んでない伊織までやる気に……！）", "zh": "（喔喔，连我没拜托的伊织都这么有干劲……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "0ff00c6bc1721f89552127d7afdf691ed0af2901917cb5a66627c4296833f91a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ！\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "4eb3589d2e91ab14e097ea3ee57d93617a845058c3dbc99f9a39feff828b512f", "ja": "どうかしたの、お兄ちゃん。\nみんなで集まって、お仕事のお話？", "zh": "怎么了，大哥哥？\n大家聚在这里是在讨论工作的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1017_p", "source_sha256": "310986a5e0b9269002ac09d35f7c21e20f0a4ea0be8a7d5e42fb77158b2890ec", "ja": "ああ、やよいに、\n次のセンターをお願いしたところなんだ。", "zh": "是啊，\n我刚拜托弥生担任下次的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "cea215a99c0556563a1a29a848efa5edeabe7e86e554be383b959c2464790bc7", "ja": "ほんと？　わぁ、すごいすごい！\nわたし、やよいさんのお手伝いしたいな！", "zh": "真的吗？哇，好棒好棒！\n我想帮弥生姊姊的忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "df8746aaef72192528af5cd2e204b0e2bdc6376314657cfb0cb6acec435c456c", "ja": "桃子も、やよいさんには、たくさんお世話に\nなってるから……いい、お兄ちゃん？", "zh": "桃子也受过弥生姊很多照顾，所以……\n可以吗，大哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b9da5756e0b16802fe9124a2d4e63b630749d9611d29ec3d13901c29d4a3f173", "ja": "もちろん。いいよな、やよい？", "zh": "当然没问题。可以吧，弥生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "50c18559f8dee03d9a72eb8cee9980dcf4179f175ea1733180493e65bfc8e5ca", "ja": "はいっ、それだと私もうれしいなーって。\n二人とも、よろしくねっ♪", "zh": "可以呀，这样我也很开心～\n麻烦你们两位啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "679ab0e2443107ab4754ba48b7a86d7f08ff9079bec506d5cdb5f94642b7f5bf", "ja": "やった～！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "太棒了～！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "359c46a045599e17aacee5a3a02614f5f20bf5a5666ba6bd8a36deb30d93ed89", "ja": "うんっ！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "505de126aa3c45f271cac6ef390ae4c1fcfdc0e1759b3e91b2d28b5ff2c154cf", "ja": "あのっ。\nジュリアさんも、お願いできますかー？", "zh": "请问，\n我也可以拜托茱莉亚姊姊参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba24fd8508eccd3e6a38253f72f6687b109ee25e17744474792a32ab3925d033", "ja": "え、あたしも？　そりゃ、ヤッコがいいなら\n喜んで出るけど……あたしが混ざっていいのか？", "zh": "咦，我也要吗？弥子觉得好的话我当然很乐意……\n不过确定要让我加入你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "df5022147e4c18cba3bbc8292de6980c95e7ecdf696588fea83e2d826f279c0b", "ja": "はいっ、ジュリアさんがいてくれたら、私も、\nビシッって決められそうかもって。……ダメですか？", "zh": "是的，有茱莉亚姊姊在的话，\n我应该也能拿出更完美的结果……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "4120f39c0befb58c257a302d67eb8b1f9cc7b5a936283c134896c62f797e8dd0", "ja": "はは、とんでもない！　そういうことなら、こっち\nから頼むよ。いいよな、{$P$}？", "zh": "哈哈，怎么会呢！既然是这样，那由我来拜托吧！\n可以吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8b3e02fb542cf56753326ea05e37993158a1c2c9daae2522f63e6c8b7da102f4", "ja": "ああ、公演の幅が広がりそうだし、いいと思う。\nよろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "嗯，这样公演内容应该会更多元，我觉得不错。\n拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "50f42b018cf433bf4d4aa19d2e652913558484aa93990b0074d5568d8362529a", "ja": "でもやよい、ビシッと決めるっていってたけど、\n公演でしたいことでもあるの？", "zh": "不过弥生，你刚才说要「拿出更完美的结果」，\n你有什么想在公演上做的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "0b422928166a3a0113ec5ac180fad1d333e80ea96cfbfa768bead743c78c981a", "ja": "あのね、私、せっかくだから、\n新しいコトがしたいなーって！", "zh": "就是呀，想说难得有机会，\n我想做新的尝试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1031_p", "source_sha256": "47459e7ab903c3159bc884f6cb3993d301b899d0c4302b1a1644d46ce70155d4", "ja": "へえ、新しいコトか。\nどんな新しいことがしたいんだ？", "zh": "哦，新的尝试吗？\n你想做哪种新尝试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "b167937290debed7bc8de0760c39b03c4210603654f965630e4c5b5756d84153", "ja": "はいっ、これから考えます！", "zh": "这个嘛，我接下来才要想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1033_p", "source_sha256": "304b6cbeb877e831bf22c5bebd1c9d36524da8dcc52abb7ba57ea5f57f881af5", "ja": "そ、そうか……！", "zh": "这、这样啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "84e32cb686c2f491e4db3d7a9344f481f46b3460883e37a31d96e98d460ddf15", "ja": "まあ、公演までまだ時間もあるし。\n焦って決めなくてもいいと思うわ。", "zh": "反正距离公演还有一段时间，\n不用急着决定没关系啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "8c41ecb602605fd4b08d2e258f167edd1d68738e1342afe539b3e0d5684c877e", "ja": "やよいさん、何か思いついたら教えてね。\n桃子も協力するから。", "zh": "弥生姊，有想到什么点子记得说一声喔，\n桃子也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "9ab5f146344f69c6c2386c0f546656d2386141991420a63988cd428802c9860e", "ja": "新しいコトかぁ。\nどんなステージになるのか、楽しみだね！", "zh": "新的尝试吗？\n好期待会变成怎样的表演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "825c04f8f26fd3f5b3e0cd4afab6972099e6f67bbcb4e7ec3f308719b4850b05", "ja": "ま、どんなコトでもどんとこいってね。\nとにかく、最高のステージにしようぜ！", "zh": "不管是什么都放马过来，\n一起打造出最棒的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "98205f60c634cfb9da7ee491e48205e02b71643357443761a94779789bca6b9c", "ja": "みんな……ありがとうございますっ。\nあらためて、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "大家……谢谢你们！\n再次请各位多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_049_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "7ac30b74c35758712a2eb2f2f3d5bc74d73d21f04ef47a2baa08ed6dc37de30a", "ja": "伊織ちゃん、私、ムズムズじゃなくて\nメラメラーってしてきちゃった！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "伊织，我现在已不是静不下心，\n而是热血沸腾了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
